<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss National Bank discount rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Swiss National Bank discount rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank said it left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent at a regular weekly meeting of its policy-setting three-man board.</p>
<p>&quot;There were no changes,&quot; said an SNB spokesman in answer to an enquiry. The meeting was moved forward a day because of the Ascension holiday on Thursday.</p>
<p>The discount rate was last changed when it was lowered from 1.50 percent on September 26, 1996. The rate now matches the historic low maintained from February 1978 to November 1979.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
